  "content": [
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 3,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "Take nothing -- Cf. (See Scofield \"Matthew 10:9\"). Also, Luke 10:4; 22:35; 3 John 1:5-8; 1 Corinthians 9:7,14."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 11,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "need of -- See, Luke 4:40; Romans 5:20.\n\nWherever there is need acknowledged the Lord is ready to meet it. Men might have put the bodily need of healing first, since that is keenly felt. Spiritual need is often the greatest where there is the least consciousness of it; cf. Revelation 3:17."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 26,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "angels -- (See Scofield \"Hebrews 1:4\")"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 28,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "And it came -- See note on the transfiguration, (See Scofield \"Matthew 17:2\")."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 43,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "the mighty power -- Or, the majesty of God."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
